ranked.chunk:
It needs a base case that stops, and a step that moves toward it
EXAMPLE
def factorial(n):
    return 1 if n <= 1 else n * factorial(n - 1)
from functools import cache
@cache
def fib(n):
    return n if n < 2 else fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2)
factorial(5), fib(50)          # (120, 12586269025)
PITFALLS
The default limit is 1000 frames ( sys.getrecursionlimit() ).Beyond it, RecursionError
Python does not optimize tail calls.Deep problems need a loop or an explicit stack
Without caching, fib  repeats work and takes exponential time.

